# Postpoststructuralist Administration: A User's Manual.

**Authors:** Lawrence, Karen R.

## Abstract
Claims poststructuralism offers vocabularies and arguments that might help administrators analyze academic practices. Argues the theory (1) offers a critique of faith in immutable truths that is usefully remembered in practicing administration; (2) provides an important reminder of the waywardness of language; and (3) is useful in its &quot;demythifying&quot; of origins and originators. (NH)

